{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43409","headline":"斑竹 · 无名氏","name":"斑竹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浓绿疎茎遶湘水，春风抽出蛟龙尾。\n色抱霜花粉黛光，枝撑蜀锦红霞起。\n交戛敲欹无俗声，满林风曳刀枪横。\n殷痕苦雨洗不落，犹带湘娥泪血腥。\n嫋娜梢头扫秋月，影穿林下疑残雪。\n我今慙愧子猷心，解爱此君名不灭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43409.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43409","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}